        <p class="kick">Newcastle & Central Coast</p>
        <h1 class="h1">Concrete <em>poured.</em><br>Finished <em>properly.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Driveways, house slabs, paths, patios, exposed aggregate & decorative finishes - formed, poured, screeded and broomed to a standard that lasts.</p>
        <div class="cta">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#lbq">Get a free quote</a>
