</header><section class="sec" id="services" aria-labelledby="s-t">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">What we do</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="s-t">Concrete for every part of the home</h2>
  <p class="lead rv">From the drive you arrive on to the patio you entertain on - every slab gets the same prep, reinforcement and finish discipline.</p>
  <div class="svc-grid">
    <article class="svc rv"><p class="svc__num">01</p><h3 class="svc__title">Driveways</h3><p class="svc__desc">Formed and reinforced driveways - plain, coloured or exposed aggregate - built to take the weight and the weather.</p></article>
    <article class="svc rv"><p class="svc__num">02</p><h3 class="svc__title">House Slabs</h3><p class="svc__desc">Waffle pod and conventional raft slabs to engineer's spec - vapour barrier, reinforcement, Termimesh and inspection ready.</p></article>
    <article class="svc rv"><p class="svc__num">03</p><h3 class="svc__title">Paths & Walkways</h3><p class="svc__desc">Front entries, side access and garden paths - formed to fall, broom or exposed finish, cut joints where needed.</p></article>
    <article class="svc rv"><p class="svc__num">04</p><h3 class="svc__title">Patios & Alfresco</h3><p class="svc__desc">Entertainment slabs at the right level - flush to internal floors, soaked for pavers or left as a finished surface.</p></article>
    <article class="svc rv"><p class="svc__num">05</p><h3 class="svc__title">Exposed Aggregate</h3><p class="svc__desc">Seeded and washed finishes in a range of stone - non-slip, hard-wearing and the classic Australian driveway look.</p></article>
    <article class="svc rv"><p class="svc__num">06</p><h3 class="svc__title">Decorative Finishes</h3><p class="svc__desc">Coloured oxides, stencil patterns, saw-cut geometry and trowel textures - detail work that lifts a plain slab.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--panel" id="finishes" aria-labelledby="f-t">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">Finishes</p>
    <h2 class="h2" id="f-t">The surface you see and feel</h2>
    <p class="lead rv">Finish isn't cosmetic - it's grip, drainage, wear resistance and how the slab ages. We match the finish to the job.</p>
    <div class="finish-strip">
      <div class="finish-head"><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.8vw,1.7rem);font-weight:900">Choose your finish</h3></div>
      <div class="finish-grid">
        <div class="finish rv">
          <div class="finish__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M2 12h20"/><path d="M2 16h20"/></svg></div>
          <div class="finish__title">Broom Finish</div>
          <div class="finish__desc">Standard non-slip texture - consistent strokes, even fall, clean edges.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="finish rv">
          <div class="finish__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></div>
          <div class="finish__title">Exposed Aggregate</div>
          <div class="finish__desc">Seeded stone washed to reveal texture - tough, timeless, high traction.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="finish rv">
          <div class="finish__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M3 15h18"/><path d="M9 3v18"/><path d="M15 3v18"/></svg></div>
          <div class="finish__title">Saw-Cut Pattern</div>
          <div class="finish__desc">Control joints cut to a grid or geometric layout - planned cracking, clean lines.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="finish rv">
          <div class="finish__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v18"/><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M12 3l4 4"/><path d="M12 3l-4 4"/></svg></div>
          <div class="finish__title">Coloured Oxide</div>
          <div class="finish__desc">Integral colour through the mix - no surface coating to peel or wear through.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="finish rv">
          <div class="finish__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/><path d="M6 15l6 6 6-6"/></svg></div>
          <div class="finish__title">Stencil / Stamp</div>
          <div class="finish__desc">Patterned texture - pavers, tile, slate or custom - sealed for longevity.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="finish rv">
          <div class="finish__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h16"/><path d="M8 8h8"/><path d="M8 16h8"/></svg></div>
          <div class="finish__title">Steel Trowel</div>
          <div class="finish__desc">Smooth, dense internal slabs - ready for tiles, vinyl or polished overlay.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="area" aria-labelledby="ar-t">
